  loadedNested() notLoaded() fabricLoads() fabricMinecraft() fabricAccepts()

part OlderJava olderJava tools/port/jar/OlderJava.java | Ports to a release on an older Java: the mod's classes lowered to it (Downgrade), with stand-ins for the JDK classes it lacks.
  jdkStandins lowerJava() MIXIN_LEVEL mixinLevel() runsOn()

