  SUBSCRIBER LISTENER Listener buses() companion() modBus()

part PortVerifier verifier tools/port/jar/PortVerifier.java | The check a ported class gets before it is written: verified as the JVM will, and its failures blamed on the reference that caused them.
  unfit fitting() Porting without() TYPE_NAME verify() NOT_ASSIGNABLE blamed() headers() known() verifiedMethod() verifyReason()

part Linking links tools/port/jar/Linking.java | Whether a reference links in the new release, as the JVM links it: where the old release declares it, where it went, and whether the mod may reach it.
  successors successor() becameInterface() superOf() declaringOld() linksNew() classOpen() memberOpen() opened() pkg() subclass() isA() functional() FieldHit fieldNow() unwrap() fieldNew() sameKind() target() widens() usable() unchangedLibrary() gameDeclared() declaringBy declaring() jdk() isInterface() present() lambda() Member provided() packagesB packagesB() subtype() OBJECT

part Overrides overrides tools/port/jar/Overrides.java | A mod's override of a game method the update renamed, retyped or replaced: moved to the new method, with a bridge where callers still use the old one.
  gameRoot() gameParents() override() tookOver() takeovers takeover() callsSuper() bridge() onlyPassed() passedOnly() lambdas() lambdaBody() moved() movedStatics alike() pair() convert() unread() bridgeCode() Bridge

part FinalOverrides finalOverrides tools/port/jar/FinalOverrides.java | A mod's override of a game method the update made final: its body moved under the hook the game now calls.
  finalHook() finalBefore() moveToHook() defaultBody() copyable() copyBody() callsSuperDirectly() callsOnSelf() Copy

